Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.970 line:0%
- I'm Dave Sasson
alongside Jeff Worthing,

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:07.173 line:0%
and welcome to the 2013
East/West Bowl,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.841 line:0%
where we're going
to be watching

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.377 line:0%
some of the best college
athletes in the nation

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.646 line:0%
try to put last year's spectacle

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.281 line:0%
