- That's right, Dave.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.749 line:0%
It won't be easy,

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.785 line:0%
but this year's seniors
certainly will be trying

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:22.655 line:0%
to give last year's stars
a run for their money.

